{"articles": [{"articleType": "news", "title": "图工程：下一次 AI 革命", "author": "ziikoo 研究院", "digest": "图不是更花哨的 Loop，而是智能体一直缺少的组织架构。", "content": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:0 auto;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:#52525B;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:0.3px;overflow-x:hidden;\">\n\n  <!-- 1. 开头引言卡片 -->\n  <section style=\"margin:10px 10px 40px;padding:32px 24px 24px;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;background:#FFFFFF;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 18px;font-weight:400;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">QUOTE</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">最强的 AI 系统，不再是一次对话，也不是无尽循环，而是</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #F97316;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">图</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:16px 0 0;letter-spacing:1px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">—— ziikoo 研究院</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 2. 编译者导读（引用类文章固定结构） -->\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:12px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">编译者导读</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">本文由</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">ziikoo 研究院</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">编译整理，内容引用自 X（Twitter）长文，版权归原作者所有，仅供学习交流。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"background:#FAFAFA;border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:20px 22px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:500;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">AUTHOR</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">原作者</span>\n        <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">@wandermist</span></span>\n        <span leaf=\"\">是</span>\n        <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 工程师</span></span>\n        <span leaf=\"\">，也是这套 Graph 系统的构建者。他在本文中拆解了这套系统的运行机制。</span>\n      </p>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:16px 0 8px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:500;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">TOPIC</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">本篇核心主题是</span>\n        <span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">图工程（Graph Engineering）</span></span>\n        <span leaf=\"\">：将 AI 工作流从「单次对话」或「死循环式迭代」，升级为可并行执行、可持续校验、可定点修复的图结构系统。</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">文章重点讨论三类问题：</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n          <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">菱形架构如何组织并行任务；</span></p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n          <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">如何识别并清理没有实际作用的「假边」；</span></p>\n        </section>\n        <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n          <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">如何划分人类与智能体在工作流中的职责边界。</span></p>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:16px 0 8px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:500;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">CONTEXT</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">过去一两周，X 上围绕</span>\n        <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">loop engineering → graph engineering</span></span>\n        <span leaf=\"\">的讨论明显升温。@wandermist 以自己参与构建的 Anthropic Graph 系统为例，把这场抽象争论拉回到一个更具体的问题：一张图究竟是如何运行的？</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">这套系统的执行链路是：</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Task → Researcher → Planner → Writer + Code Agent → Reviewer → Deploy</span></span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">其中包含六个专业执行节点、一份共享状态，以及沿着边实时流转的数据包。每个节点负责明确的专业任务，整张图则驱动工作流从输入一直运行到部署。</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">当任务被拆解为真正清晰的专业分工后，传统的 loop 模式也随之退场：不再由一个智能体包办所有工作。Reviewer 一旦发现问题，会将任务精准退回到出现错误的节点，而不是重启整张图，也不会丢失已有上下文。</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">从这个角度看，图并不是更复杂、更花哨的循环，而是智能体系统长期缺失的那张</span>\n        <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">组织架构图</span></span>\n        <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3F3F46;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">这篇长文，正是对这一转向的系统化归纳：</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">「图不是更花哨的 Loop，而是智能体一直缺少的组织架构。」</span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"border-left:2px solid #E4E4E7;padding:12px 0 12px 20px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">原文：Graph Engineering: The Next AI Revolution</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">链接：https://x.com/wandermist/status/2080974834851340400</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:12px;border-left:3px solid #52525B;line-height:1.4;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">以下为原文编译</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是 wandermist——这篇我差点没发。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">所有人都在谈</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI 智能体</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。几个月前，最火的技能还是提示词工程。接着是循环工程（loop engineering）：让模型反复改进自己的产出。今天，讨论又在转向。最强的 AI 系统，不再是一次对话，也不是无尽循环，而是</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">图（graph）</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这不只是又一个 buzzword。它是一种不同的思考方式：</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI 如何解决问题</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 3. 前言导读 -->\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px 40px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:2px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">本文看点</span>\n    </p>\n    <section style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\">\n      <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;margin-right:8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">图工程如何重组工作流</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;margin-right:8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">菱形架构与并行校验</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"flex:1;background:#FAFAFA;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:18px 12px 16px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"><span leaf=\"\">人机协作的系统边界</span></p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 01 线性 AI 的问题 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">01</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">PROBLEM</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">线性 AI 的问题</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">多数人仍把 AI 当成</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">一个员工</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">来用。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">你提问</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型思考</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">它回答</span></p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">简单任务够用。但真实工作很少这么</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">直来直去</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">想象写一份市场研究报告：有人收集竞品数据，有人研究用户行为，有人核对数字，最后有人在发布前做总审。把这些职责都塞进一次 AI 对话，就像让一个人同时</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">身兼数职</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。能做，但很难扩展。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这正是</span>\n      <span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">图工程（Graph Engineering）</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">要解决的问题。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicnNgzaelMqXYiaBNzpyv2PdsWAnsshR2S9MZhxu4Ao5wNcPlFNzUKjaNE6TQwGkYrktmxk4gAMzcj62wVyu7KX8j8wJH8ibKt59k/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- divider -->\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 02 什么是图工程？ -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">02</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">DEFINITION</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">什么是图工程？</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图工程是一种实践：把 AI 工作流设计成</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">互联网络</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">，而不是一条直线流水线。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图中每个</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">节点只负责一件事</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。一个节点做调研，一个写稿，一个校验来源，另一个决定下一步走哪条路径。节点之间的连接，定义信息如何在系统中流动。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFickIsNc7Zn7mdTEic3NTJIkmm9vfBuTXePhopWverUysGXeDg1nXlPdGlbllg2uNeMxXeib0ZoCA7wO6OK6DgThvlGFgwlcsIVy0E/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">你不是让一个 AI 包办一切，而是在组建一支</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">协作团队</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">，每个成员职责清晰。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">结果不只是执行更快。你会得到更易理解、调试、改进和</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">扩展的系统</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 03 为什么图很重要 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">03</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">PARALLEL</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">为什么图很重要</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图结构系统的一大优势是</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">并行执行</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">假设要调研五家竞品。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">传统工作流会先做 A 公司，再做 B，再做 C……每一步都要等上一步结束。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图结构可以同时启动五个调研节点。结果齐了之后，再由另一个节点汇总成一份报告。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicnnJK03KlqxWTzgoOibb8fSPxXbk5W5J4fraDeedBORt0r8lC3tLI35u3YIn4Vo6Bjy6l8zfUTE6PG5Lwg4sEFLTUz4NHaibKiboQ/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">「只有真正需要等待时，才等待。」</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这一个设计决策，往往就能</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">大幅缩短执行时间</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">，同时产出更丰富。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 04 不是每条箭头都该存在 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">04</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">EDGES</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">不是每条箭头都该存在</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">构建 AI 系统时，最容易犯的错之一，是把彼此并不依赖的步骤</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">硬连在一起</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">很多工作流之所以被串行化，只是因为当初就按串行画的。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">如果「总结 PDF」和「查明天日程」毫无关系，为什么一个要等另一个？</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图工程逼你只问一个简单问题：</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"border-left:3px solid #52525B;padding:16px 0 16px 24px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">「这个任务真的依赖前一步的结果吗？」</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">如果答案是「不」，依赖就该删掉。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">去掉这些</span>\n      <span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">假边</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">，对工作流的改进，常常比再加一个模型还大。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 05 菱形模式 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">05</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">DIAMOND</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">菱形模式</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">随着图结构 AI 系统越来越常见，一种架构反复出现。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">工作流先从</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">规划</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">开始。然后分叉成多个并行工作者，各自从不同角度探索。接着是</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">校验</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">：独立智能体挑战已有结论，而不是照单全收。最后，一切合并成单一答复。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这个模式常被称为</span>\n      <span style=\"background:#F4F4F5;color:#27272A;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;\"><span leaf=\"\">菱形架构（Diamond Architecture）</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。它其实就是人类做了几十年的事。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">评审</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">合并</span></p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicnhPVuqdI87W44vbmIvH9qhtv9o4GP8xxXwEsmiaicf9n1FJBoKvzSZ7kibGIcwkOAFtBseYrP5OpSTPZtia5AoibI7G6CMxA5TjWEk/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">系统不再轻信第一个答案，而是</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">先制造分歧，再达成共识</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这一步很简单，却能显著提高</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">输出可靠性</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 06 校验比生成更有价值 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">06</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">VERIFY</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">校验比生成更有价值</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">生成内容已经很容易。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">信任内容仍然很难。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">关于 AI 最大的误解之一，是假设同一个模型就该</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">审核自己的工作</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">实际上，</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">独立校验几乎总是更稳</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">专职审核者可以追问：</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">信息是否事实正确？</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">来源是否仍然时效？</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">这条建议是否真正回应了原始目标？</span></p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">不同审核者应挑战工作的不同侧面：</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">准确性、时效性、逻辑、证据</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"border-left:3px solid #F97316;padding:14px 0 14px 22px;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;margin:0;line-height:1.75;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">图工程把「创造」与「校验」拆开，让整个系统更可靠。</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 07 更多智能体 ≠ 更好结果 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">07</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">AGENTS</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">更多智能体 ≠ 更好结果</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">很多构建者就是栽在这里。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">如果每一步都依赖上一步，再堆智能体通常只增加复杂度，却不提升表现。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图结构只有在工作</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">天然可拆成独立部分</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">时，才会真正发挥优势。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">如果流程必须串行，一个能力够强的智能体，往往比十个协调中的智能体更有效。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">问题从来不是：</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;color:#27272A;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:14px 10px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">「工作在哪里天然分叉？」</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">而不是「我该加多少智能体？」</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 08 人仍然属于这张图 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">08</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">HUMANS</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">人仍然属于这张图</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">目标不是去掉人，而是把人放在</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">价值最大的位置</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;background:#F4F4F5;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#52525B;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span><span leaf=\"\">发布文章</span></span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;background:#F4F4F5;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#52525B;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span><span leaf=\"\">发送客户邮件</span></span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;background:#F4F4F5;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#52525B;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span><span leaf=\"\">批准金融交易</span></span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;background:#F4F4F5;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;background:#52525B;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span><span leaf=\"\">上线产品</span></span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"border:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding:4px;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      <section style=\"margin:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/G54UQVjjFicmibynpeZqPfHoVN7AdiakDjAUn16gqfgIeQ4xTxP8CVYHIb0NMdbZKvhmTc4nUDHG38YaVDiczvlGKibSz1mqUsSbXEfBoHTtibLMk/0?from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\"></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这些如果盲目自动化，代价很高。最聪明的 AI 系统不会取消人类判断，而是把判断留给</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">最关键的决策</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">其余都可以自动发生。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"height:1px;background:#E4E4E7;margin:0;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\"><br></span>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ∞ 结语 -->\n  <section style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"position:relative;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E4E7;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#E4E4E7;margin:0;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">∞</span>\n      </p>\n      <section style=\"margin-top:-8px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">THE END</span>\n        </p>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#27272A;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.5px;line-height:1.4;\">\n          <span leaf=\"\">图工程本质上是系统设计</span>\n        </h3>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">说到底，图工程不关于「图」本身，而关于像</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">系统设计者</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">一样思考。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">1</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">每个节点只有一个职责</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">2</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">每条连接都有理由</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">3</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">每次评审都有目的</span></p>\n      </section>\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;background:#27272A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;\"><span leaf=\"\">4</span></span>\n        <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#52525B;margin:0;line-height:1.75;flex:1;\"><span leaf=\"\">每次审批都有成本</span></p>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">当这些原则合在一起，AI 就不再像聊天机器人，而开始像一支</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">协作团队</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">这才是今天真正发生的转变。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">提示词工程教我们如何与模型沟通。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">循环工程教我们如何通过迭代改进推理。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">图工程教我们如何</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #F97316;font-weight:700;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">协调智能</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;text-align:justify;color:#52525B;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      <span leaf=\"\">随着 AI 系统更大、更自主、更深地嵌入业务，设计工作流——而不是只写提示词——可能成为现代 AI 中</span>\n      <span style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #52525B;font-weight:600;color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">最有价值的能力之一</span></span>\n      <span leaf=\"\">。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- END -->\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px;\">\n    <section style=\"text-align:center;margin:0 0 36px;\">\n      <section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n        <span style=\"height:1px;width:48px;background:#E4E4E7;margin-right:16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#A1A1AA;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:500;\"><span leaf=\"\">END</span></span>\n        <span style=\"height:1px;width:48px;background:#E4E4E7;margin-left:16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 签名 -->\n  <section style=\"padding:0 10px 24px;\">\n    <section style=\"border-top:1px solid #E4E4E7;padding-top:28px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">我是</span>\n        <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">ziikoo 研究院</span></strong>\n        <span leaf=\"\">，关注 AI 系统、智能体协作与工作流设计。本文内容引用并编译自 @wandermist 的推特原文，版权归原作者所有。</span>\n      </p>\n      <p style=\"margin-bottom:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#52525B;text-align:justify;\">\n        <span leaf=\"\">如果你觉得今天这篇有收获，欢迎</span>\n        <strong style=\"color:#27272A;\"><span leaf=\"\">点赞、在看、转发</span></strong>\n        <span leaf=\"\">三连，我们下篇见。</span>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n</section>\n", "thumbMediaId": "xv9tsA2b6d4MzpARc-AiwATInmMfCt4tAXzfZCRTgAZsbkbT0NdPeVmQvZZuqYPf", "contentSourceUrl": "https://x.com/wandermist/status/2080974834851340400", "needOpenComment": 0, "onlyFansCanComment": 0}]}